      "description": "SEI QiM U.S. Equity Factor Allocation Active ETF is an actively managed core U.S. equity solution managed by SEI's Quantitative Investment Management (QiM) team, a group within SEI Investments Management Corporation (SIMC). The Fund brings SEI's established U.S. Equity Factor Allocation strategy to the ETF market, combining dynamic factor allocation, active stock selection, and disciplined risk management within a diversified equity portfolio. Rather than targeting a single factor, SEUS is designed to adapt as market conditions evolve while maintaining exposure to historically rewarded factors -- such as quality, value, momentum, and low volatility -- through a risk-aware, model-based investment process.",
